A step fetch is a separate process issued by a spawned sub-agent, so the exemption has to hold for it
too: `migrate --step survey` behind the same marker reaches the render path, evidenced by the vault
log line the gate would have short-circuited.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- cmd --
booping render-playbook migrate --step survey --output out.md
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
-- expected/cwd/vault/.booping.log --
[..]Z: [render-playbook] migrate --step survey → out.md
